  "summary": "Haitian art movement combining Vodou symbolism with abstract expressionist techniques.",
  "description": "Features abstract compositions with bold colors, symbolic forms, and spiritual themes inspired by Vodou cosmology, created by artists at the Saint Soleil community in Soisson-la-Montagne. This movement emerged as a response to the oppressive Duvalier regime, creating a visual language that expressed cultural identity and spiritual resistance through modernist abstraction.",
